                    <pre class="code-panel " data-lang="typescript"><code># 创建 Skill 目录
mkdir -p .claude/skills/code-review

# 创建 SKILL.md
cat > .claude/skills/code-review/SKILL.md << 'SKILLEOF'
# Code Review Skill

## Description
Perform comprehensive code review with best practices.

## Usage
When user asks for code review, use this skill.

## Steps
1. Read the code file
2. Check for:
   - Code style violations
   - Potential bugs
   - Performance issues
   - Security vulnerabilities
3. Provide detailed feedback

## Triggers
- "review code"
- "check code quality"
- "code review"
SKILLEOF

# Skill 自动加载
# 当用户说 "review code" 时，会自动推荐此 Skill</code></pre>
                    <pre class="code-panel active" data-lang="python"><code># 创建 Skill 目录
